      "explanation": "Site-specific provisions for RM exception 269 set minimum lot area, lot frontage, side yard setback and maximum lot coverage, height and floor space index by building type (detached house, semi-detached house, duplex, triplex), and allow a duplex or triplex to be attached to one other of the same type on an adjacent lot. No prevailing by-laws apply.",
